#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And calculate the value of the cut. The solution is not optimal due to noise"
" (the cut value of the optimal solution is 5).\n"
msgstr ""
"Y calcular el valor del corte. La solución no es óptima debido al ruido (el "
"valor del corte de la solución óptima es 5).\n"

